new: would write
{
  "name": "laptop",
  "domains": [
    {
      "name": "docs",
      "versioning": true,
      "symlinks": "keep",
      "maxCache": "1 GiB",
      "backends": [
        {
          "type": "local",
          "name": "main",
          "role": "main",
          "path": "/srv/docs"
        }
      ],
      "frontends": [
        {
          "type": "http-proxy",
          "port": 5446,
          "secret": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

== an existing config: what is not asked is kept, an unused link dropped
  Domains:
    1. docs: 2 backends
? [a]dd [e]dit N [r]emove N [g]lobals [w]rite [q]uit -> e 1
? domain name [docs] -> 
? versioning [true] -> 
? symlinks (keep, follow, skip) [keep] -> 
? read-only [false] -> 
? chunk size (blank: the store's) -> 
? cache chunk size (blank: default) -> 
? cache limit [1 GiB] -> 2 GiB
    1. main (local, main)
    2. far (http-proxy, replica)
? backends: [a]dd [e]dit N [r]emove N [d]one [d] -> a
? type (gcs, http-proxy, local, s3) [local] -> local
? backend name -> copy
? role (main, replica, backfill, readOnly) [main] -> 
? Store root -> /srv/copy
? Verify chunk writes [true] -> 
    1. main (local, main)
    2. far (http-proxy, replica)
    3. copy (local, main)
? backends: [a]dd [e]dit N [r]emove N [d]one [d] -> d
    1. http-proxy
? frontends: [a]dd [e]dit N [r]emove N [d]one [d] -> d
  Domains:
    1. docs: 3 backends
? [a]dd [e]dit N [r]emove N [g]lobals [w]rite [q]uit -> w
edit: would write
{
  "name": "box",
  "links": { "wan": { "maxRate": 1000, "minRate": 200 } },
  "domains": [
    {
      "name": "docs",
      "symlinks": "keep",
      "versioning": true,
      "frontends": [ "http-proxy" ],
      "backends": [
        {
          "type": "local",
          "name": "main",
          "role": "main",
          "path": "/srv/docs"
        },
        {
          "type": "http-proxy",
          "name": "far",
          "role": "replica",
          "link": "wan",
          "url": "https://far.example:5446",
          "secret": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"
        },
        {
          "type": "local",
          "name": "copy",
          "role": "main",
          "path": "/srv/copy"
        }
      ],
      "maxCache": "2 GiB"
    }
  ]
}

